# pleamar-wm's session: ~/.config/pleamar/session.conf (`pleamar-wm init` puts
# this there).
# What is not said here is taken from Hyprland's configuration (~/.config/hypr:
# its monitor lines, kb_layout, accel_profile, sensitivity), if there is one.
# `pleamar-wm config` shows what comes out.

# monitor NAME  WxH@HZ | preferred | highest  [at X,Y]  [scale S]  [vrr]  [off]
#monitor DP-3 1920x1080@165 at 0,0
#monitor HDMI-A-1 preferred at 1920,0

# keyboard  layout L  variant V  options O  repeat KEYS_A_SECOND  delay MS
#keyboard layout es repeat 25 delay 400

# pointer / touchpad  accel flat|adaptive  speed -1..1  natural on|off  tap on|off  dwt on|off
#pointer accel flat
#touchpad tap on natural on

# idle  off-after SECONDS  (the monitors go dark; any input wakes them)
#idle off-after 600
